5,1,1,talk,Toshio,,We need to know which past projects actually worked for the people using them.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I am concerned about how much time the construction process steals from our academic calendar.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,The staff who maintain these buildings are already stretched thin. We must consider their workload.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,Recent projects have consistently slipped schedules. I want to understand why the calendar keeps breaking.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,The approved figures rarely match the final cost. I am interested in where the money actually goes.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Mizuki, do you have specific examples of the schedule slips you mentioned?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
