12,1,2,talk,George,,Mostly the technicians. They handle the daily routines without relief.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Yes, the last two jobs lost months to unexpected site conditions.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Toshio, I agree. We need data on post-occupancy satisfaction to see if the spend was worth it.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will look into the post-occupancy reviews and the survey findings in older blocks.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I will check the timetable records for rooms out of service and the booking data.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,I will investigate the staffing posts since the hiring freeze and the bench technicians' routines.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,I will look at the weather days in site diaries and the decade of delivery schedules.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will review the tender records and the renewal reserve for equipment.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
