35,2,1,talk,Toshio,,The post-occupancy data is clear. Projects with broad access were rated highest.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Victoria,,My findings confirm my fears. We pay for off-site space when rooms are closed.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,George,,"The technicians have spare hours, but the grounds staff are unfilled. The burden is uneven.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,I found that weather kills outdoor projects. Six weeks lost to rain and frost is unacceptable.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,The mechanical plant costs have risen by a fifth. We are not budgeting for that inflation.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Mizuki, that weather data is critical. It rules out any outdoor-heavy plans.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@George, if the technicians have spare hours, can they handle the maintenance for a new facility?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,George,,"They can, but only if the equipment is automated. Manual routines are eating their time.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Benjamin, the cost inflation is a major risk. We need a plan that is robust to price changes.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Toshio, the post-occupancy ratings suggest we should prioritize spaces that are widely bookable.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Toshio,,I agree with Benjamin. A space that serves many departments will have higher satisfaction.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Victoria,,The booking data shows specialist rooms are idle. We should not build more of those.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,George,,I support a plan that reduces manual labor for the technicians.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,I am leaning towards an indoor project. The weather risk is too high for outdoor work.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,The lack of a renewal reserve for AV kit is a red flag. We need to account for lifecycle costs.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
